WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.220
On your phone, open Quick update.

2
00:00:02.220 --> 00:00:05.653
Tap Add a review.

3
00:00:05.653 --> 00:00:11.534
Paste their words exactly.
Do not tidy them up.

4
00:00:11.534 --> 00:00:14.246
Their first name, the way
they would like it shown.

5
00:00:14.246 --> 00:00:17.085
And their town.

6
00:00:17.085 --> 00:00:19.303
Google reviews keep their stars.

7
00:00:19.303 --> 00:00:23.734
Tap the button. It is on
the website in minutes.
